1
00:01:17,640 --> 00:01:20,200
Go to hell, you old geezer.

2
00:01:22,240 --> 00:01:23,520
What are you doing?

3
00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:25,360
Sir,

4
00:01:25,360 --> 00:01:27,120
I'm massaging your feet.

5
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:45,640
Mrs. He,

6
00:01:45,880 --> 00:01:47,160
Zhangxin just called

7
00:01:47,160 --> 00:01:49,160
and said Dad woke up in the hospital.

8
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:53,920
Sir!

9
00:01:54,680 --> 00:01:55,440
Sir,

10
00:01:55,440 --> 00:01:56,700
you're finally awake.

11
00:01:56,920 --> 00:01:59,280
My prayers day and night weren't in vain.

12
00:02:02,240 --> 00:02:03,520
She's

13
00:02:03,520 --> 00:02:05,240
not He Mei at all.

14
00:02:09,479 --> 00:02:10,720
How dare you

15
00:02:10,960 --> 00:02:12,360
deceive the Master?

16
00:02:13,760 --> 00:02:14,720
Master,

17
00:02:14,720 --> 00:02:15,680
I've already taught her a lesson for you.

18
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:16,560
Madam He.

19
00:02:17,480 --> 00:02:18,640
The Master

20
00:02:19,800 --> 00:02:20,860
knows everything.

21
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:23,920
You...

22
00:02:25,440 --> 00:02:27,770
How long are you going
to keep this from me?

23
00:02:28,079 --> 00:02:28,960
Master,

24
00:02:28,960 --> 00:02:30,520
I was wrong, Master.

25
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:33,000
I know how much you miss your daughter.

26
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:35,480
I couldn't bear to see you running around,

27
00:02:35,880 --> 00:02:37,520
so I used this white lie

28
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:38,760
to deceive you.

29
00:02:39,160 --> 00:02:40,160
Master,

30
00:02:40,160 --> 00:02:41,760
you must believe me.

31
00:02:41,960 --> 00:02:43,800
I did all this for your own good.

32
00:02:44,079 --> 00:02:45,200
Shut up!

33
00:02:46,160 --> 00:02:47,200
Let me tell you,

34
00:02:47,440 --> 00:02:49,440
I have already found the real He Mei.

35
00:03:03,080 --> 00:03:03,840
Dad.

36
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:15,400
How could you be He Mei?

37
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:31,240
This thing could be forged.

38
00:03:32,079 --> 00:03:32,920
Zhang Xin,

39
00:03:33,640 --> 00:03:35,920
how long are you going
to keep acting crazy?

40
00:03:35,920 --> 00:03:36,920
Let me tell you,

41
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:38,930
I've already confirmed it.

42
00:03:39,040 --> 00:03:41,240
Li Zhangxin is my biological daughter.

43
00:03:42,120 --> 00:03:44,000
She came to my side a long time ago.

44
00:03:44,680 --> 00:03:45,880
But I...

45
00:03:46,079 --> 00:03:48,079
never noticed her.

46
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:53,600
The real He Mei died a long time ago.

47
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:56,280
Impossible.

48
00:03:57,320 --> 00:03:58,120
Impossible.

49
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:01,640
You must wish I were dead.

50
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:03,320
Zhang Xin!

51
00:04:05,160 --> 00:04:07,420
You were nothing but a foot massage girl.

52
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:09,760
My mom took pity on you

53
00:04:09,760 --> 00:04:12,160
and brought you
into the He family as a maid.

54
00:04:12,640 --> 00:04:15,280
But you wanted to take her place,
so you killed her.

55
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:17,079
And you wanted to kill me, too.

56
00:04:20,560 --> 00:04:21,560
Impossible.

57
00:04:44,360 --> 00:04:45,240
Miss,

58
00:04:45,240 --> 00:04:46,000
how much?

59
00:04:48,640 --> 00:04:49,170
Get lost.

60
00:05:00,480 --> 00:05:01,320
Mrs. He,

61
00:05:02,760 --> 00:05:04,200
long time no see.

62
00:05:06,960 --> 00:05:08,160
He Mei is not dead.

63
00:05:10,560 --> 00:05:12,120
You know I sent the text.

64
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:14,000
It really was you.

65
00:05:15,880 --> 00:05:16,840
Mrs. He,

66
00:05:17,200 --> 00:05:19,200
you were too ruthless.

67
00:05:23,320 --> 00:05:24,920
If you had killed He Mei back then,

68
00:05:24,920 --> 00:05:25,760
Let go. No, no.

69
00:05:25,920 --> 00:05:27,960
this wouldn't be happening today.

70
00:05:28,520 --> 00:05:30,000
And I wouldn't let Li Zhangxin

71
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:31,240
walk all over me.

72
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:34,480
Mrs. He,

73
00:05:34,760 --> 00:05:36,240
murder is illegal.

74
00:05:36,960 --> 00:05:38,280
If I get caught,

75
00:05:38,480 --> 00:05:39,680
you as the instigator

76
00:05:39,680 --> 00:05:40,880
won't escape either.

77
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:43,700
Since Li Zhangxin is
such a headache for you,

78
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:44,680
why not

79
00:05:44,680 --> 00:05:46,340
bring me back to the He family?

80
00:05:46,440 --> 00:05:49,240
That way you'd have an extra helper,
wouldn't you?

81
00:05:53,880 --> 00:05:55,940
I will never take someone like you...

82
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:58,760
The scum who messed things up.

83
00:06:07,840 --> 00:06:09,080
Mei,

84
00:06:09,080 --> 00:06:11,680
you've suffered so much
out there all these years.

85
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:13,680
I'll try my best to make it up to you.

86
00:06:16,960 --> 00:06:17,760
Hurry up.

87
00:06:17,800 --> 00:06:18,720
We're just waiting for you.

88
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:19,380
Take a seat.

89
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:22,760
Since everyone is here,

90
00:06:22,960 --> 00:06:25,080
I have an important announcement to make.

91
00:06:25,080 --> 00:06:27,040
I am leaving my entire estate

92
00:06:27,360 --> 00:06:28,560
to

93
00:06:29,640 --> 00:06:30,480
He Mei.

94
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:33,400
What?

95
00:06:35,560 --> 00:06:37,690
Your eldest son is sitting right here.

96
00:06:37,760 --> 00:06:41,480
You're already the CEO of He Group.

97
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:43,760
What about He Yu?

98
00:06:43,760 --> 00:06:44,880
I have no objections.

99
00:06:44,880 --> 00:06:45,960
Mei can have it all.

100
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:48,360
Sir,

101
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:51,440
I've been with you through thick and thin
for over a decade.

102
00:06:51,440 --> 00:06:53,200
Leaving me with nothing in the end,

103
00:06:53,200 --> 00:06:54,360
is that fair?

104
00:06:55,880 --> 00:06:57,600
You killed Mei's mother

105
00:06:57,680 --> 00:06:59,000
and tried to kill her too.

106
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:00,960
And you still have the nerve
to ask for the inheritance?

107
00:07:00,960 --> 00:07:02,400
Not holding you accountable

108
00:07:02,400 --> 00:07:04,040
is already merciful enough.

109
00:07:16,640 --> 00:07:18,440
Li Zhangxin.

110
00:07:20,400 --> 00:07:21,560
That old bastard,

111
00:07:21,840 --> 00:07:23,800
he actually left all the inheritance
to Li Zhangxin.

112
00:07:23,800 --> 00:07:24,680
Hubby.

113
00:07:25,840 --> 00:07:26,640
Hubby.

114
00:07:26,640 --> 00:07:27,920
As long as we treat Zhangxin well,

115
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:29,680
I believe she won't hurt us.

116
00:07:30,880 --> 00:07:32,140
You don't understand.

117
00:07:32,840 --> 00:07:35,840
From the moment Li Zhangxin
returned to the He family,

118
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:37,400
she was coming for me.

119
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:39,090
What are you talking about?

120
00:07:42,280 --> 00:07:44,560
If Li Zhangxin takes over the He family,

121
00:07:44,760 --> 00:07:46,680
we'll have nothing

122
00:07:47,560 --> 00:07:48,840
and be kicked out.

123
00:07:50,400 --> 00:07:53,040
Can you bear to see
your husband lose everything?

124
00:07:53,040 --> 00:07:53,760
No,

125
00:07:53,760 --> 00:07:55,240
I can't hurt Zhangxin.

126
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:58,200
Then before I get kicked out,

127
00:07:58,520 --> 00:08:00,600
I'll kick you out first.

128
00:08:01,960 --> 00:08:02,360
Then...

129
00:08:02,360 --> 00:08:03,560
Then what should I do?

130
00:08:37,760 --> 00:08:39,200
Why did you burn me?

131
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:44,760
It's not even a fraction

132
00:08:45,600 --> 00:08:47,320
of what you did to me.

133
00:08:49,520 --> 00:08:51,980
Do you know how long
I've waited for this day?

134
00:08:52,320 --> 00:08:55,160
I finally don't have to stare
at you in the dark,

135
00:08:55,720 --> 00:08:57,520
but can stand before you openly

136
00:08:57,960 --> 00:09:00,280
as He Mei.

137
00:09:00,720 --> 00:09:02,600
Do you think I'm afraid of you?

138
00:09:02,880 --> 00:09:04,200
That damn Liu Dan

139
00:09:04,280 --> 00:09:05,880
is completely useless.

140
00:09:06,160 --> 00:09:07,200
If it weren't for him,

141
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:08,480
you'd be dead by now.

142
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:15,240
Heaven just didn't want to take me.

143
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:17,320
Which means

144
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:19,560
your karma has arrived.

145
00:09:21,080 --> 00:09:22,320
Fine.

146
00:09:22,720 --> 00:09:23,920
Let's see

147
00:09:23,920 --> 00:09:25,920
who gets the last laugh.

148
00:09:27,160 --> 00:09:27,960
Good.

149
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:29,720
I thought

150
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:31,580
you'd beg for mercy on your knees,

151
00:09:31,680 --> 00:09:33,240
but you're still as arrogant as ever.

152
00:09:33,240 --> 00:09:35,240
Then don't blame me

153
00:09:37,440 --> 00:09:38,570
for being ruthless.

154
00:09:52,080 --> 00:09:52,880
Zhangxin,

155
00:09:53,600 --> 00:09:55,160
Tomorrow is He Yu's birthday.

156
00:09:55,160 --> 00:09:56,480
I want to buy him a gift.

157
00:09:56,480 --> 00:09:57,760
Do you want to come with me?

158
00:09:57,760 --> 00:09:58,840
He Yu's birthday.

159
00:09:58,840 --> 00:09:59,920
I almost forgot.

160
00:09:59,920 --> 00:10:00,520
Let's go.

161
00:10:26,800 --> 00:10:28,200
Where are we going?

162
00:10:30,320 --> 00:10:31,450
We're almost there.

163
00:10:34,680 --> 00:10:37,210
Why are we driving
into the middle of nowhere?

164
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:46,780
Get out.

165
00:10:49,920 --> 00:10:51,240
I'm sorry, Zhangxin.

166
00:10:52,360 --> 00:10:54,160
I have to protect my marriage.

167
00:11:05,400 --> 00:11:07,000
You're awake.

168
00:11:08,240 --> 00:11:09,040
What?

169
00:11:09,040 --> 00:11:10,680
Forgot your dad

170
00:11:11,560 --> 00:11:13,400
now that you're rich?

171
00:11:15,640 --> 00:11:16,800
This kid is pretty sneaky.

172
00:11:16,800 --> 00:11:17,840
Keep a close eye on him
once you take him back.

173
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:19,700
Of course. Don't let him get away.

174
00:11:22,800 --> 00:11:24,160
Hey, pretty girl.

175
00:11:26,560 --> 00:11:27,800
Let's go.

176
00:11:27,800 --> 00:11:29,440
Time to go home.
